Zarad invaded the sanctuary, but his troops were slaughtered. The defeated warriors were seized by a black light and rose under Midranda's control, forcing Zarad to retreat.
Midranda altered the Water of Life of the Spring of Zairweus to make everyone it bathes his slave.
The sea people's sacred ground has been desecrated by Midranda.

I am sending Arteres and Ceres to investigate the area.
Please, help them investigate the Sanctuary of the Abyss.

[Challenge Objective]

Go to the marked area in the Sanctuary of the Abyss.
When you are done, talk to Sage Celina in Pillai.
